        "## Qualitative Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "Based on the generated images and measured runtime:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **10 steps:** fastest generation, but may show weaker details, softer structure, or visible artifacts.\n",
        "- **20 steps:** often provides a practical balance between speed and acceptable quality.\n",
        "- **30 steps:** usually improves structure and detail while keeping latency moderate.\n",
        "- **50 steps:** may improve fine details, but the additional compute cost may not always produce a proportionally large visual improvement.\n",
        "\n",
        "This supports the main efficiency argument from the survey: diffusion inference can often be accelerated by reducing sampling steps, but there is a tradeoff between speed and perceptual quality."
      ]
